==Rarity==
{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}
On the Gielinor surface, young implings have a 20/100 chance to appear out of a low-tier invisible spawn. The same holds for the low-tier invisible spawns present in Puro-Puro. In addition to these however, there are also a number of fixed spawns in Puro-Puro that will always yield a young impling. 

For a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.

